    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Dievio B2B Leads -> Google Sheets\n\n### What this template does\n- Accepts POST request with Dievio filters\n- Calls Dievio `POST /api/public/search` through HTTP Request node\n- Collects B2B contacts and appends rows to Google Sheets\n- Returns JSON summary to webhook caller\n\n### Required setup\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 credential in n8n\n- Spreadsheet with a target tab (sheet)\n- In node **Run Dievio Search**, set header **X-API-Key** to your Dievio API key\n\n### Dievio API docs\n- Overview: https://docs.dievio.com/api-reference/overview\n- Search: https://docs.dievio.com/api-reference/search\n- Filters: https://docs.dievio.com/api-reference/filters\n- Authentication: https://docs.dievio.com/api-reference/authentication",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "note-guide",
      "name": "Workflow Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1824,
        -768
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Example request\n\n### POST body\n```json\n{\n  \"spreadsheetId\": \"1AbCdEf...\",\n  \"sheetName\": \"Leads\",\n  \"perPage\": 100,\n  \"maxResults\": 1000,\n  \"includeEmails\": true,\n  \"includePhones\": false,\n  \"emailStatus\": \"verified\",\n  \"filters\": {\n    \"job_titles\": [\"Founder\", \"CEO\"],\n    \"job_title_seniority\": [\"owner\", \"cxo\"],\n    \"person_location_country\": [\"United States\"],\n    \"industries\": [\"Software\", \"SaaS\"],\n    \"business_model\": [\"b2b\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### cURL\n```bash\ncurl -X POST 'https://YOUR_DOMAIN/webhook/dievio-b2b-leads' \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"spreadsheetId\":\"1AbCdEf...\",\"sheetName\":\"Leads\",\"perPage\":100,\"maxResults\":1000,\"includeEmails\":true,\"filters\":{\"job_titles\":[\"Founder\"],\"person_location_country\":[\"United States\"]}}'\n```\n\n### Important\n- API key is configured in **Run Dievio Search** node header, not in webhook body.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "note-example",
      "name": "Request Example Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1024,
        -768
      ]
    },
    {
